s="p-4 font-mono">{{ cost.date }}</td><td class="p-4"><div class="font-bold">{{ financeCostCategoryText(cost.category) }}</div><div v-if="cost.autoGenerated" class="text-[9px] text-emerald-600 font-bold mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles mr-1"></i>自动生成</div></td><td class="p-4"><div class="font-bold">{{ financeCostScopeText(cost) }}</div><div v-if="cost.clientId" class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 mt-1">{{ financeCostClientName(cost) }}</div></td><td class="p-4">{{ cost.vendor || '—' }}</td><td class="p-4 font-black text-slate-700">{{ formatMoney(cost.amount,cost.currency) }}</td><td class="p-4 font-black text-amber-600">{{ financeVisibleCostAllocatedText(cost) }}</td><td class="p-4 text-slate-500">{{ cost.note || '—' }}</td><td class="p-4 text-right"><div v-if="cost.autoGenerated" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 text-[10px] font-bold" title="自动成本由开户渠道、网络环境或收入项目生成，请在对应来源资料中修改"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>来源联动</div><div v-else class="flex justify-end gap-1"><button @click="openCostModal(cost)" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 text-blue-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen"></i></button><button @click="deleteFinanceCost(cost)" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-rose-50 text-rose-500"><i class="fa-regular fa-trash-can"></i></button></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
            <div v-else class="py-10 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">当前周期暂无成本记录。</div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-100 bg-amber-50/60 px-4 py-3 text-[11px] text-amber-800 leading-relaxed">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1.5"></i><b>核算规则：</b>预计返点来自已归属渠道的广告消耗 × 广告发生日期对应的有效返点政策；实际返点以代理商最终对账金额为准。实际返点只在「代理商返点对账单」确认；系统按“开户商 + 对接人 + 结算月份”保存唯一对账结果，并按各客户在该渠道当月的返点贡献权重自动归集到客户盈利明细。
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl soft-shadow overflow-visible">
            <div class="p-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <div><div class="font-extrabold text-sm">客户盈利明细</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">只读查看客户关联收入、回款、广告消耗、返点归集、成本与净利润；公司独立收入不会进入任何客户盈利。</div></div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400">当前 {{ financeRows.length }} 个客户</span>
            </div>

            <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-500"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mr-1.5 text-indigo-500"></i>客户盈利只使用顶部“核算周期 + 客户”筛选；开户商筛选只用于上方渠道返点对账，不再拆分客户关联收入与客户利润。</div>
              <select v-model.number="profitPageSize" @change="profitPage=1" class="h-9 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 text-xs font-semibold"><option :value="10">每页 10 个客户</option><option :value="20">每页 20 个客户</option><option :value="30">每页 30 个客户</option><option :value="50">每页 50 个客户</option></select>
            </div>

            <div v-if="financeRows.length" class="overflow-auto scrollbar max-h-[620px]">
              <table class="w-full min-w-[1360px] text-left text-xs">
                <thead class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-400 sticky top-0 z-10 shadow-[0_1px_0_0_rgba(226,232,240,1)]"><tr><th class="p-4">客户</th><th class="p-4">客户关联收入</th><th class="p-4">已收款</th><th class="p-4">广告消耗</th><th class="p-4">开户商 / 对接人</th><th class="p-4">预计返点</th><th class="p-4">实际返点归集</th><th class="p-4">归属成本</th><th class="p-4">预计净利润</th><th class="p-4">当前 / 已确认净利润</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                  <tr v-for="row in financeProfitPagedRows" :key="row.client.id" class="hover:bg-slate-50/70">
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-extrabold text-slate-900">{{ row.client.name }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">{{ row.client.project || row.client.product }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">月费 {{ formatMoney(row.client.monthlyFee,row.client.currency) }}</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black text-emerald-600">{{ spendGroupsText(row.receivableGroups) }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">{{ row.receivableCount }} 个收入项目 · {{ financeReceivableIncomeBreakdownText(row.receivableRows) }}</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black text-blue-600">{{ spendGroupsText(row.paidGroups) }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">仅反映实际回款</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black text-amber-600">{{ spendGroupsText(row.spendGroups) }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">统一广告数据汇总</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4 max-w-[300px]"><div v-if="row.channelLabels.length" class="space-y-1"><div v-for="label in row.channelLabels" :key="label" class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-blue-700">{{ label }}</div></div><span v-else class="text-slate-400">未关联开户商</span></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black text-violet-600">{{ spendGroupsText(row.expectedRebateGroups) }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">政策自动预估</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black text-blue-700">{{ spendGroupsText(row.actualRebateGroups) }}</div><div class="mt-1"><span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full text-[9px] font-extrabold" :class="row.actualEntryCount?'bg-blue-50 text-blue-700':'bg-amber-50 text-amber-700'">{{ row.actualEntryCount ? `已确认对账 ${row.actualEntryCount} 条` : '待代理商对账' }}</span></div><div class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 mt-1">按渠道确认返点贡献比例自动归集</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black text-amber-600">{{ spendGroupsText(row.costGroups) }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">客户专属 + 公共成本分摊</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black text-slate-900">{{ spendGroupsText(row.expectedNetProfitGroups) }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">客户关联收入 + 预计返点 − 成本</div></td>
                    <td class="p-4"><div class="font-black" :class="row.actualProfitConfirmed?'text-emerald-700':'text-amber-600'">{{ spendGroupsText(row.actualNetProfitGroups) }}</div><div class="text-[9px] font-bold mt-1" :class="row.actualProfitConfirmed?'text-emerald-600':'text-amber-600'">{{ row.actualProfitLabel }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">客户关联收入 + 实际返点 − 成本</div></td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div v-else class="py-16 text-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar text-3xl text-slate-300"></i><div class="text-sm font-extrabold mt-3">当前筛选范围暂无财务数据</div><p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">可清除客户筛选，或重新选择核算日期 / 统计周期。</p></div>

            <div v-if="financeRows.length" class="px-4 py-3 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">显示第 <b class="text-slate-700">{{ profitPageStart + 1 }}</b> - <b class="text-slate-700">{{ profitPageEnd }}</b> 个客户，共 <b class="text-slate-700">{{ financeRows.length }}</b> 个</div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><button @click="profitPage=Math.max(1,profitPage-1)" :disabled="profitPage<=1" class="h-8 px-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-[10px] font-bold disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed hover:bg-slate-50"><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left mr-1"></i>上一页</button><span class="h-8 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-950 text-white text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center">{{ profitCurrentPage }} / {{ financeProfitTotalPages }}</span><button @click="profitPage=Math.min(financeProfitTotalPages,profitPage+1)" :disabled="profitPage>=financeProfitTotalPages" class="h-8 px-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-[10px] font-bold disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed hover:bg-slate-50">下一页<i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right ml-1"></i></button></div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </section>

        <!-- Media Buying Tools / 投放工具 -->
        <section v-else-if="currentPage==='tools'" key="tools" class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4">
            <div><div class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-emerald-500">MEDIA BUYING TOOLKIT</div><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mt-1">投放工具</h2><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">先选择客户，再选择该客户的 Facebook / TikTok 具体账号，查看这个账号正在使用的工具。</p></div>
            <button @click="openToolModal()" class="h-10 px-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-sm transition"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus mr-1.5"></i>添加投放工具</button>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 soft-shadow">
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
              <div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[.12em] text-emerald-500">CLIENT → ACCOUNT → TOOL</div><div class="font-extrabold text-sm mt-1">选择工具使用范围</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">客户与账号采用两级筛选。选定具体账号后，只显示绑定该账号或绑定该客户全部账号的工具。</div></div>
              <div class="hidden sm:flex w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 items-center justify-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-filter"></i></div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_48px_1fr] gap-3 items-end">
              <div class="rounded-2xl border p-4 transition" :class="selectedToolClientId==='ALL'?'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70':'border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/30'">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-black">1</span><div><div class="text-xs font-extrabold">选择客户</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">先确定工具属于哪个客户</div></div></div>
                <select v-model="selectedToolClientId" class="field tool-select">
                  <option value="ALL">全部客户 / 工具库</option>
                  <option v-for="c in clients" :key="c.id" :value="String(c.id)">{{ c.name }}</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="hidden lg:flex h-full items-center justify-center text-slate-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl border p-4 transition" :class="selectedToolClientId==='ALL'?'border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/40 opacity-70':'border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/30'">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-black">2</span><div><div class="text-xs font-extrabold">选择客户账号</div><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Facebook / TikTok 账号独立查看</div></div></div>
                <select v-model="selectedToolAccountKey" :disabled="selectedToolClientId==='ALL'" class="field tool-select account-select">
                  <option value="ALL">{{ selectedToolClientId==='ALL' ? '请先选择客户' : '全部账号' }}</option>
                  <option v-for="item in selectedToolClientAccounts" :key="item.key" :value="item.key">{{ item.label }}</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div v-if="selectedToolClientId!=='ALL'" class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-950 text-white px-4 py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
              <div class="min-w-0"><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold">当前查看范围</div><div class="text-sm font-extrabold mt-1 truncate">{{ selectedToolClientName }}</div><div class="text-[10px] text-emerald-300 mt-1 truncate"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield mr-1"></i>{{ selectedToolAccountName }}</div></div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-5 shrink-0"><div class="text-right"><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">匹配工具</div><div class="text-xl font-black text-emerald-400">{{ filteredMediaTools.length }}</div></div><button @click="openToolModal()" class="h-9 px-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 text-[10px] font-black"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus mr-1"></i>为此范围添加工具</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 soft-shadow"><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">{{ selectedToolClientId==='ALL' ? '工具总数' : (selectedToolAccountKey==='ALL'?'当前客户工具':'当前账号工具') }}</div><div class="text-2xl font-black mt-1">{{ toolStats.total }}</div></div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl p-4 soft-shadow"><div class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600">使用中</div><div class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-600 mt-1">{{ toolStats.active }}</div></div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-4 soft-shadow"><div class="text-[10px] text-blue-600">账号绑定</div><div class="text-2xl font-black text-blue-600 mt-1">{{ toolStats.bindings }}</div></div>
            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 soft-shadow"><div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">工具分类</div><div class="text-2xl font-black mt-1">{{ toolStats.categories }}</div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 soft-shadow flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-2"><div class="relative flex-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-300 text-xs"></i><input v-model.trim="toolSearch" class="h-10 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-200 pl-9 pr-3 text-xs outline-none" placeholder="搜索工具名称 / 用途 / 登录账号" /></div><select v-model="toolCategoryFilter" class="h-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 text-xs font-semibold"><option value="ALL">全部分类</option><option value="BROWSER">指纹浏览器</option><option value="CREATIVE">素材 / 创意</option><option value="LANDING">落地页 / 建站</option><option value="ANALYTICS">数据分析</option><option value="CRM">CRM / 线索</option><option value="SPY">广告情报</option><option value="OTHER">其他工具</option></select></div>

          <div v-if="filteredMediaTools.length" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <div v-for="tool in filteredMediaTools" :key="tool.id" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-5 soft-shadow">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div clas